# Go2-X5-lab
# Ignore local caches, generated artifacts, logs, and development-side working notes.

# OS / crash dumps
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
**/.thumbs
**/*.dmp

# Python cache / test cache
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/*.egg-info/
.eggs/
.coverage
.coverage.*

# IDE
**/.idea/
**/.vscode/
!.vscode/
!.vscode/**

# Isaac Sim / packman
_isaac_sim*/
_repo/
_build/
.lastformat

# Build / runtime outputs
logs/
runs/
output/
outputs/
videos/
recordings/
results_csv/
wandb/
.neptune/
docker/artifacts/

# Temporary files
*.tmp
*.bak
*.swp
*.swo

# Local model / dataset caches
modelscope/
models/
*.npz

# Documentation publish allow-list
# Only README.md and requirements.txt are intended to be pushed from the repo root.
# Current docs are pushed from docs/README.md, docs/Readme_CN.md,
# docs/user, and stable appendix images. docs/development is local only.
*.md
*.txt
README
!/README.md
!/requirements.txt

# Development / AI collaboration notes
AGENT.md
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md
GEMINI.md
COPILOT.md
repair.md
robot_lab.md
train-p1.md
train-p2.md
/P3.md
/P4.md
/P5.md
train_route/
docs/README.full-preserved.md
**/.cursorrules
**/.windsurfrules
**/.agents/
**/.codex/

# Documentation publishing policy
# Push current user docs and public indexes. Keep development, history, training,
# runtime screenshots, and other working notes local.
!docs/
docs/*
!docs/README.md
!docs/Readme_CN.md
!docs/appends/
docs/appends/*
!docs/appends/images/
!docs/appends/images/**
!docs/user/
!docs/user/**
docs/development/
docs/history/
docs/train/
docs/appends/media/

# Sim2sim workspace generated outputs and local binary payloads.
!sim2sim/
!sim2sim/README.md
sim2sim/build/
sim2sim/install/
sim2sim/log/
sim2sim/logs/
sim2sim/devel/
sim2sim/cmake_build*/
sim2sim/.catkin_tools/
sim2sim/library/
sim2sim/policy/**/*.pt
sim2sim/policy/**/*.onnx
